  "notes": "{乖離|かいり} is a formal term often used in academic, business, and political contexts. It suggests things that should be connected or aligned have drifted apart.\n\nCommon collocations:\n- {乖離|かいり}が{生|しょう}じる: a gap emerges\n- {乖離|かいり}が{大|おお}きい: a large gap\n- 〜と〜の{乖離|かいり}: gap between ~ and ~\n\nRelated terms:\n- {隔|へだ}たり: gap, distance\n- {ずれ}: discrepancy, gap\n- {齟齬|そご}: discrepancy, mismatch",
